      "text": "Increasing in <b><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math></b>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "wZ38Y",
      "text": "Increasing in  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  and decreasing in  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dOjEw",
      "text": "Decreasing in  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  and increasing in  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
