  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0&#160; &#160; &#160;&#160;</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math><br /><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
